# Not committed on purpose: a macOS-generated lockfile omits Linux native
# binaries (sharp, rolldown), which breaks `npm ci` on Cloudflare (npm bug
# #4828). Without a lockfile, Cloudflare runs `npm install`, which resolves the
# correct per-platform binaries. Kept locally for reproducible local installs.
package-lock.json

# Gallery photos pulled from Google Drive at build time (Drive is the source of
# truth; these are regenerated on every build, so never commit them).
public/images/gallery/drive/

# Google Cloud service-account key files — NEVER commit. The key belongs in
# .env.local (local) and Cloudflare Pages env vars (deploy), not in the repo.
vocal-entity-*.json
*-service-account*.json
*serviceaccount*.json
gcp-*.json
credentials*.json

